********ideally whenever we are giving ternary operator and if it fails due to not symbol it will go to 2nd condition and 2nd conditon is headless -true
headless:!process.env.CI ? false:true, 
and for local -local doesnt understand CI so it will be undefined now the operation is false but due to ! it will make true and once the opration is true it willgo to 1stpart
and for CI condition- CI is present so condition is true then with ! it will make false -when condition is false it go to 2nd part

